---
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description={`What data ${SITE_TITLE} collects.`}>
	<p><em>Last updated: October 9, 2026</em></p>
	<h2>What we collect</h2>
	<p>
		This site does not ask you for personal information and has no accounts or comment forms. If you
		email us, we use your address only to reply.
	</p>
	<h2>Cookies from booking sites</h2>
	<p>
		When you click an affiliate link, the booking site (for example Klook or Booking.com) may set a
		cookie so it can tell that you came from {SITE_TITLE}. Those cookies are controlled by the booking
		site and covered by its own privacy policy.
	</p>
	<h2>Hosting</h2>
	<p>
		The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may log visitors' IP addresses for security, as described
		in GitHub's privacy statement.
	</p>
	<h2>Changes</h2>
	<p>If we add analytics or other tools, we will update this page first.</p>
</Layout>
